# Never deploy to production

Never deploy to production. Only Alex deploys to prod after validating in INT.

- Do not run `npm run deploy`, `npm run deploy:vinext`, `npx vinext-cloudflare deploy`, `npx wrangler deploy`, or `wrangler deploy`.
- Do not patch `node_modules/cf` (or any `strict` flag) to force a deploy.
- Do not target Worker `releva`. INT, if ever asked, is `releva-int` via `scripts/deploy-int.sh` only.
- Pushing this branch is not a deploy. Do not merge to `main` unless Alex asks.
